{
  "sourcePatchId": "7d9e5a02-a2e9-4287-b810-e04142ea2dbb",
  "name": "Enough",
  "description": "Dry polyphonic MIDI port of Enough from joel / ebmtranceboy's altamax (https://ide.csound.com/editor/pXPRc5Y1vALtxqgszdhI). Four per-instance controls: Timbre, Evolution, Release, Level. Velocity controls output gain only. 1 ms MIDI attack/decay, full sustain; no source mixer effects. Five editable oscil3 operators preserve the 20:4:9:3:1 network and evolving depths. The original 0.0001 self-feedback is omitted; cubic lookup and oscillator phase differ from its sample loop.",
